anding in search of rhaegar targaryen  he was demanding to see rhaegar to  answer for his sister's abduction  but rhaegar wasn't there the mad king  had brandon stark arrested for  threatening his son's life  then sometime shortly after that their  father rickard stark  was summoned to the red key where he was  then arrested as well  he demanded a trial by combat the mad  king responded by choosing fire as his  champion  rickard was hung on the rafters with  chains over a burning fire  his son brandon was given a choice if he  could reach out to the sword laying on  the ground  he could free his father however he had  a chain tied around his neck  and the sword was out of reach brandon  stark strangulated himself to reach out  to the sword while his father rickard  was roasted alive in his armor this  sounds like something you would see in  one of those saw movies  afterwards the mad king demanded ned  stark and robert baratheon's heads  he wanted to execute them before they  could gather up forces and retaliate  but john aaron was not about to hand  them over he raised his own banners  instead  rebelling against the crown john aaron  was loyal until the very end  and i'm sure this is one of the many  reasons why robert baratheon made him  the hand of the king  now as sad as ned was he showed more  concern for his wife catelyn  and her family he wanted to make sure  liza and her son robin were all right  by now they have already left king's  landing heading for the eerie  this concerns catelyn because she  doesn't want liza to be by herself  this is also when we find out that  catelyn's uncle the black fish  was already in the veil jon arryn had  made him the knight of the gate  make sure you remember that for later  this is when ned tries to convince  catelyn to go to the vale to be with her  sister  he says liza's son needs to be around  other children  go be with her and fill her halls with  noise and shouts and laughter  but catelyn informs ned that she cannot  leave winterfell just yet  robert baratheon is already on his way  he is riding to winterfell to speak with  ned immediately  this news does make ned feel better  catelyn notices the sadness leave his  face  and you might not believe this but ned  actually smiles when he finds out robert  is on his way  this also just goes to show you how much  ned loves robert  he is very anxious to see his old friend  again he sends jory to meet them so he  can escort them the rest of the way  this makes me kind of sad when i think  about it because ned was so excited to  see robert again  but we all know what this reunion will  lead to  even catelyn wanted to express her  happiness with him but she knew  something wasn't right about all of this  she remembers what she heard about the  dead direwolf lying in the snow  she is afraid of what this means the  direwolf and the stag are the sigils of  house stark and baratheon  and they were both found dead in the  snow now a baratheon is on his way to  see a stark  lady catelyn must wonder what this means  for her family  we already know now the rest of this  chapter  basically just talks about who might be  coming with robert baratheon  this is when ned finds out that all the  lannister children are on their way as  well  we find out that ned has a major issue  with house lannister  but more specifically he does not like  tywin or jaime lannister  you see when ned and robert were  fighting to remove the mad king from the  iron throne  the lannisters waited until victory was  all but certain before they decided to  show up  ned has never forgiven them for that  lady catelyn reminds ned that he better  watch his mouth around cersei  she says the lannister woman as her  queen and her pride is said to grow with  every passing year  the dysfunctional relationship between  the starks and lannisters is set up  right away  so far each chapter has done a great job  at advancing the plot  it's becoming more and more obvious that  how stark has 